                        "entry_id": "584d09c9-5f4e-3ded-a2f5-8fc700a8cd59",
                        "glosses": [
                            "osłona przeciwsłoneczna zasłaniająca okno lub drzwi, składająca się z równoległych poziomych lub pionowych listewek, pasów materiału, tworzywa sztucznego lub blachy, regulowanych tak, aby wpuszczać pożądaną ilość światła"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9dcde485-b3d6-3407-b10a-48e360039f26",
                        "entry_id": "584d09c9-5f4e-3ded-a2f5-8fc700a8cd59",
                        "glosses": [
                            "metalowa krata zabezpieczająca okno lub drzwi sklepu, zwijana na czas jego otwarcia"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72f02b93-2909-4e56-b6e5-110f3c2cf225",
                        "source_entry_id": "584d09c9-5f4e-3ded-a2f5-8fc700a8cd59",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cf6177e-87c3-39fe-9b28-f4513777cd22",
                        "target_lang_word": "Venetian blind",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Venetian blind",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6041ddcc-ac7f-3a58-92d9-140914bf46d5",
                                        "entry_id": "4ba751d4-5dda-394a-b89a-50e33f5ad511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A blind consisting of overlapping horizontal, flat slats, usually made of metal, vinyl or wood, that can be tilted so as to let in more or less light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d71bcd38-e893-441f-baa0-c8552f399dc8",
                                                "sense_id": "6041ddcc-ac7f-3a58-92d9-140914bf46d5",
                                                "text": "The rest of the apartment was filled with that soft green light where the noon is excluded by Venetian blinds, or the still softer shadow of creeping plants:..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c32a2d94-c6dd-4cf7-a986-19d27db7d9a4",
                                                "sense_id": "6041ddcc-ac7f-3a58-92d9-140914bf46d5",
                                                "text": "A narrow and deserted street in deep shadow, high houses, innumerable windows with Venetian blinds, a dead silence, grass sprouting between the stones, imposing carriage archways right and left, immense double doors standing ponderously ajar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a37f38c-402c-4080-bc03-274297923bd4",
                                                "sense_id": "6041ddcc-ac7f-3a58-92d9-140914bf46d5",
                                                "text": "Every traveller on the demonstration runs was soon entranced with the most noticeable - the individual electric motors to raise, lower and adjust the venetian blinds in each double-glazed window, which are under the passenger's control in each seating bay by means of little thumb switches below the frames; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b3b5948e-4f5d-489e-9198-c6729de52c34",
                        "source_entry_id": "584d09c9-5f4e-3ded-a2f5-8fc700a8cd59",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cf6177e-87c3-39fe-9b28-f4513777cd22",
                        "target_lang_word": "jalousie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jalousie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d85417f9-7e4c-3d45-91c6-b3dfbfc7ecd5",
                                        "entry_id": "48bb775f-af2a-3aa1-a38b-93cd80d8580d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A component in a ventilation system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8942ddc9-a8bc-31c5-812c-f7b9010b03ea",
                                        "entry_id": "48bb775f-af2a-3aa1-a38b-93cd80d8580d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Upward sloping window slats which form a blind or shutter, allowing light and air in but excluding rain and direct sun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0adb8634-74fb-47a2-98b6-11dce6f7bef3",
                                                "sense_id": "8942ddc9-a8bc-31c5-812c-f7b9010b03ea",
                                                "text": "A small lofty room, with its window wide open, and the wooden jalousie-blinds closed, so that the dark night only showed in slight horizontal lines of black, alternating with their broad lines of stone colour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bda4a91e-7e5d-4264-b3be-f11fc28c5cc4",
                                                "sense_id": "8942ddc9-a8bc-31c5-812c-f7b9010b03ea",
                                                "text": "Nowhere the glitter of a glass casement; Venetian blinds, jalousies, closed every window, and rooms projected in all directions to catch the luxury of a through-draft of air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46d7b2ce-db2d-37b6-a26b-ac4b63b73288",
                                        "entry_id": "48bb775f-af2a-3aa1-a38b-93cd80d8580d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pastry with the upper side sliced before final baking to resemble a wooden slatted blind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "737f614c-9116-4c26-ad84-b09d2900da39",
                        "source_entry_id": "584d09c9-5f4e-3ded-a2f5-8fc700a8cd59",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cf6177e-87c3-39fe-9b28-f4513777cd22",
                        "target_lang_word": "louver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "louver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
